    "explanation": "As Samuro has a hard time dealing with Knockbacks, Heroes like Lúcio and E.T.C. can greatly reduce his effectiveness by pushing him away at every possible aggression. He also suffers against Heroes that can easily kill his images, like Jaina, Orphea or Cassia with Surge of Light. Furthermore, Heroes that benefit from hitting clones can be a problem, such as Medivh, or Diablo.\n\nStukov is exceptional against Samuro because of Biotic Armor and Flailing Swipe, which can greatly reduce Samuro's damage."
